    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In May 2026, the trusted grid guardian worked to protect the Visayas region after a sudden operational interruption at a power unit. Duty-bound decision-makers issued a protective warning and implemented emergency measures to maintain grid stability, responding to increased demand due to heat that strained the system. Their actions aimed to prevent a large-scale power deficit, though a significant power shortfall still affected the area as over 950 megawatts became unavailable.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-2",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "When the affected power unit experienced a sudden shutdown, the grid management authority declared a red alert for the affected community in the Visayas. This grid management action, combined with load shedding for grid stability, was a direct response to prolonged operational challenges and ongoing maintenance issues across eleven power generators. The measures sought to mitigate the energy deficit, highlighting the system's vulnerability to equipment failure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.72
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Public authorities in the Philippines acted to safeguard the region in need of stability after Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2 tripped offline. Their emergency response, including load shedding, was necessitated by a heatwave impact that drove high demand and compounded the effects of other long-running plant outages. This collective effort aimed to address the resulting power shortage and protect critical energy infrastructure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
